# Dependency Zero — example environment.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit a filled-in `.env`; it is already
# ignored. No value in this file is a secret.
#
# Every variable is OPTIONAL. The app boots with none of them set and degrades to
# honest "not connected" states rather than failing.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PERSISTENT STORAGE — REQUIRED IN PRODUCTION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where scans, firewall events, attestations and the Ed25519 signing keys live.
#
# On an ephemeral filesystem (most serverless platforms, containers without a
# volume) everything here is lost on every cold start, INCLUDING THE SIGNING
# KEYS. Regenerated keys cannot verify evidence signed by the old ones.
#
# Point this at a mounted persistent volume. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
# DZ_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/dependency-zero

# Set to 1 ONLY when you have confirmed each Dependency Zero process (the Next
# server, the OpenCode guard, any test run) has its own DZ_DATA_DIR. The
# file-backed store serialises writes within one process only; two processes
# sharing a file can lose records.
# DZ_STORE_ISOLATED=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SOLANA DEVNET RPC (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default: the public https://api.devnet.solana.com, which is rate limited.
# Point at a provider for a public demo. The cluster stays Devnet regardless —
# this setting changes WHERE requests are sent, not WHICH network is used.
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEVNET ATTESTER KEY (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed for automated anchoring. Without one, scans still complete and
# proofs are still exportable and verifiable; anchoring is simply skipped and
# reported as "not started".
#
# Never put a seed phrase anywhere. Never commit either value.
# DZ_SOLANA_KEYPAIR_BASE58=comma,separated,64,bytes
# DZ_SOLANA_KEYPAIR_FILE=/secure/path/to/devnet-attester.json